>Denloye</surname><given-names>OO</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Periodontal status and treatment needs of 12&#x02013;15 year old institutionalized mentally handicapped school children in Ibadan, Nigeria</article-title><source>Odontostomatol</source><year>1999</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>38</fpage><lpage>40</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11372094</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Oredugba</surname><given-names>FA</given-names></name><name><surname>Sote</surname><given-names>EO</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Oral hygiene status of handicapped children in Lagos, Nigeria</article-title><source>Nig J Gen Pract</source><year>2001</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>75</fpage><lpage>79</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Oredugba</surname><given-names>FA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of oral health care services and oral findings in children with special needs in Lagos, Nigeria</article-title><source>Special Care Dentist</source><year>2006</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>59</fpage><lpage>65</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16681240</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1754-4505.2006.tb01511.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Green</surname><given-names>LW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Manual for scoring socioeconomic status for research on health behaviour</article-title><source>Publ Hlth Rep</source><year>1970</year><volume>85</volume><fpage>815</fpage><lpage>827</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>World Health Organization</collab></person-group><source>Oral Health Surveys Basic Methods</source><year>1997</year><edition>4